{"suttaId":"thi-ap25","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-iii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[8981,9141],"vripara":"166"},"segments":{"thi-ap25:0.3":"Nandātherīapadānaṃ","thi-ap25:1.1":"“Padumuttaro nāma jino, sabbadhammāna pāragū;","thi-ap25:1.3":"Ito satasahassamhi, kappe uppajji nāyako.","thi-ap25:2.1":"“Ovādako viññāpako, tārako sabbapāṇinaṃ;","thi-ap25:2.3":"Desanākusalo buddho, tāresi janataṃ bahuṃ.","thi-ap25:3.1":"“Anukampako kāruṇiko, hitesī sabbapāṇinaṃ;","thi-ap25:3.3":"Sampatte titthiye sabbe, pañcasīle patiṭṭhapi.","thi-ap25:4.1":"“Evaṃ nirākulaṃ āsi, suññataṃ titthiyehi ca;","thi-ap25:4.3":"Vicittaṃ arahantehi, vasībhūtehi tādibhi.","thi-ap25:5.1":"“Ratanānaṭṭhapaññāsaṃ, uggatova mahāmuni;","thi-ap25:5.3":"Kañcanagghiyasaṅkāso, bāttiṃsavaralakkhaṇo.","thi-ap25:6.1":"“Vassasatasahassāni, āyu vijjati tāvade;","thi-ap25:6.3":"Tāvatā tiṭṭhamāno so, tāresi janataṃ bahuṃ.","thi-ap25:7.1":"“Tadāhaṃ haṃsavatiyaṃ, jātā seṭṭhikule ahuṃ;","thi-ap25:7.3":"Nānāratanapajjote, mahāsukhasamappitā.","thi-ap25:8.1":"“Upetvā taṃ mahāvīraṃ, assosiṃ dhammadesanaṃ;","thi-ap25:8.3":"Amataṃ paramassādaṃ, paramatthanivedakaṃ.","thi-ap25:9.1":"“Tadā nimantayitvāna, sasaṅghaṃ lokanāyakaṃ;","thi-ap25:9.3":"Datvā tassa mahādānaṃ, pasannā sehi pāṇibhi.","thi-ap25:10.1":"“Jhāyinīnaṃ bhikkhunīnaṃ, aggaṭṭhānamapatthayiṃ;","thi-ap25:10.3":"Nipacca sirasā dhīraṃ, sasaṅghaṃ lokanāyakaṃ.","thi-ap25:11.1":"“Tadā adantadamako, tilokasaraṇo pabhū;","thi-ap25:11.3":"Byākāsi narasārathi,‘lacchase taṃ supatthitaṃ.","thi-ap25:12.1":"“‘Satasahassito kappe, okkākakulasambhavo;","thi-ap25:12.3":"Gotamo nāma gottena, satthā loke bhavissati.","thi-ap25:13.1":"“‘Tassa dhammesu dāyādā, orasā dhammanimmitā;","thi-ap25:13.3":"Nandāti nāma nāmena, hessati satthu sāvikā’.","thi-ap25:14.1":"“Taṃ sutvā muditā hutvā, yāvajīvaṃ tadā jinaṃ;","thi-ap25:14.3":"Mettacittā paricariṃ, paccayehi vināyakaṃ.","thi-ap25:15.1":"“Tena kammena sukatena, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","thi-ap25:15.3":"Jahitvā mānusaṃ dehaṃ, tāvatiṃsamagacchahaṃ.","thi-ap25:16.1":"“Tato cutā yāmamagaṃ, tatohaṃ tusitaṃ gatā [agaṃ (sī. pī. ka.)];","thi-ap25:16.3":"Tato ca nimmānaratiṃ, vasavattipuraṃ tato [gatā (syā.)].","thi-ap25:17.1":"“Yattha yatthūpapajjāmi, tassa kammassa vāhasā;","thi-ap25:17.3":"Tattha tattheva rājūnaṃ, mahesittamakārayiṃ.","thi-ap25:18.1":"“Tato cutā manussatte, rājānaṃ cakkavattinaṃ;","thi-ap25:18.3":"Maṇḍalīnañca rājūnaṃ, mahesittamakārayiṃ.","thi-ap25:19.1":"“Sampattiṃ anubhotvāna, devesu manujesu ca;","thi-ap25:19.3":"Sabbattha sukhitā hutvā, nekakappesu saṃsariṃ.","thi-ap25:20.1":"“Pacchime bhave sampatte, suramme [purasmiṃ (syā.)] kapilavhaye;","thi-ap25:20.3":"Rañño suddhodanassāhaṃ, dhītā āsiṃ aninditā.","thi-ap25:21.1":"“Siriyā [siriṃva (sī.), raṃsiriva (syā.)] rūpiniṃ disvā, nanditaṃ āsi taṃ kulaṃ;","thi-ap25:21.3":"Tena nandāti me nāmaṃ, sundaraṃ pavaraṃ ahu.","thi-ap25:22.1":"“Yuvatīnañca sabbāsaṃ, kalyāṇīti ca vissutā;","thi-ap25:22.3":"Tasmimpi nagare ramme, ṭhapetvā taṃ yasodharaṃ.","thi-ap25:23.1":"“Jeṭṭho bhātā tilokaggo, pacchimo [majjhimo (pī.)] arahā tathā;","thi-ap25:23.3":"Ekākinī gahaṭṭhāhaṃ, mātarā paricoditā.","thi-ap25:24.1":"“‘Sākiyamhi kule jātā, putte buddhānujā tuvaṃ;","thi-ap25:24.3":"Nandenapi vinā bhūtā, agāre kiṃ nu acchasi.","thi-ap25:25.1":"“‘Jarāvasānaṃ yobbaññaṃ, rūpaṃ asucisammataṃ;","thi-ap25:25.3":"Rogantamapicārogyaṃ, jīvitaṃ maraṇantikaṃ.","thi-ap25:26.1":"“‘Idampi te subhaṃ rūpaṃ, sasīkantaṃ manoharaṃ;","thi-ap25:26.3":"Bhūsanānaṃ alaṅkāraṃ, sirisaṅghāṭasannibhaṃ.","thi-ap25:27.1":"“‘Puñjitaṃ lokasāraṃva, nayanānaṃ rasāyanaṃ;","thi-ap25:27.3":"Puññānaṃ kittijananaṃ, ukkākakulanandanaṃ.","thi-ap25:28.1":"“‘Na cireneva kālena, jarā samadhisessati [samabhibhossati (sī. syā.), samadhihessati (pī.)];","thi-ap25:28.3":"Vihāya gehaṃ kāruññe [kāruññe (sī. pī.), pārayhiṃ (syā.)], cara dhammamanindite’.","thi-ap25:29.1":"“Sutvāhaṃ mātu vacanaṃ, pabbajiṃ anagāriyaṃ;","thi-ap25:29.3":"Dehena na tu cittena, rūpayobbanalāḷitā.","thi-ap25:30.1":"“Mahatā ca payattena, jhānajjhena paraṃ mama;","thi-ap25:30.3":"Kātuñca vadate mātā, na cāhaṃ tattha ussukā.","thi-ap25:31.1":"“Tato mahākāruṇiko, disvā maṃ kāmalālasaṃ [kamalānanaṃ (syā.)];","thi-ap25:31.3":"Nibbindanatthaṃ rūpasmiṃ, mama cakkhupathe jino.","thi-ap25:32.1":"“Sakena ānubhāvena, itthiṃ māpesi sobhiniṃ;","thi-ap25:32.3":"Dassanīyaṃ suruciraṃ, mamatopi surūpiniṃ.","thi-ap25:33.1":"“Tamahaṃ vimhitā disvā, ativimhitadehiniṃ;","thi-ap25:33.3":"Cintayiṃ saphalaṃ meti, nettalābhañca mānusaṃ.","thi-ap25:34.1":"“Tamahaṃ ehi subhage, yenattho taṃ vadehi me;","thi-ap25:34.3":"Kulaṃ te nāmagottañca, vada me yadi te piyaṃ.","thi-ap25:35.1":"‘Na vañcakālo subhage [pañhakālo subhaṇe (sī. syā. pī.)], ucchaṅge maṃ nivāsaya;","thi-ap25:35.3":"Sīdantīva mamaṅgāni, pasuppaya muhuttakaṃ’.","thi-ap25:36.1":"“Tato sīsaṃ mamaṅke sā, katvā sayi sulocanā;","thi-ap25:36.3":"Tassā nalāṭe patitā, luddhā [lūtā (syā.)] paramadāruṇā.","thi-ap25:37.1":"“Saha tassā nipātena, piḷakā upapajjatha;","thi-ap25:37.3":"Pagghariṃsu pabhinnā ca, kuṇapā pubbalohitā.","thi-ap25:38.1":"“Pabhinnaṃ vadanañcāpi, kuṇapaṃ pūtigandhanaṃ;","thi-ap25:38.3":"Uddhumātaṃ vinilañca, pubbañcāpi sarīrakaṃ.","thi-ap25:39.1":"“Sā paveditasabbaṅgī, nissasantī muhuṃ muhuṃ;","thi-ap25:39.3":"Vedayantī sakaṃ dukkhaṃ, karuṇaṃ paridevayi.","thi-ap25:40.1":"“‘Dukkhena dukkhitā homi, phusayanti ca vedanā;","thi-ap25:40.3":"Mahādukkhe nimuggamhi, saraṇaṃ hohi me sakhī’.","thi-ap25:41.1":"“‘Kuhiṃ vadanasobhaṃ te, kuhiṃ te tuṅganāsikā;","thi-ap25:41.3":"Tambabimbavaroṭṭhaṃ te, vadanaṃ te kuhiṃ gataṃ.","thi-ap25:42.1":"“‘Kuhiṃ sasīnibhaṃ vaṇṇaṃ, kambugīvā kuhiṃ gatā;","thi-ap25:42.3":"Doḷālolāva [dāmāmālañca (syā.), dololullāva (ka.)] te kaṇṇā, vevaṇṇaṃ samupāgatā.","thi-ap25:43.1":"“‘Makuḷakhārakākārā [makulamburūhākārā (sī.), makuḷapadumākārā (syā.)], kalikāva [kalasāva (sī. syā. pī.)] payodharā;","thi-ap25:43.3":"Pabhinnā pūtikuṇapā, duṭṭhagandhittamāgatā.","thi-ap25:44.1":"“‘Vedimajjhāva sussoṇī [tanumajjhā puthussoṇī (sī. syā.), vedimajjhā puthussoṇī (pī.)], sūnāva nītakibbisā;","thi-ap25:44.3":"Jātā amejjhabharitā, aho rūpamasassataṃ.","thi-ap25:45.1":"“‘Sabbaṃ sarīrasañjātaṃ, pūtigandhaṃ bhayānakaṃ;","thi-ap25:45.3":"Susānamiva bībhacchaṃ, ramante yattha bālisā’.","thi-ap25:46.1":"“Tadā mahākāruṇiko, bhātā me lokanāyako;","thi-ap25:46.3":"Disvā saṃviggacittaṃ maṃ, imā gāthā abhāsatha.","thi-ap25:47.1":"“‘Āturaṃ kuṇapaṃ pūtiṃ, passa nande samussayaṃ;","thi-ap25:47.3":"Asubhāya cittaṃ bhāvehi, ekaggaṃ susamāhitaṃ.","thi-ap25:48.1":"“‘Yathā idaṃ tathā etaṃ, yathā etaṃ tathā idaṃ;","thi-ap25:48.3":"Duggandhaṃ pūtikaṃ vāti, bālānaṃ abhinanditaṃ.","thi-ap25:49.1":"“‘Evametaṃ avekkhantī, rattindivamatanditā;","thi-ap25:49.3":"Tato sakāya paññāya, abhinibbijjha dakkhasi’.","thi-ap25:50.1":"“Tatohaṃ atisaṃviggā, sutvā gāthā subhāsitā;","thi-ap25:50.3":"Tatraṭṭhitāvahaṃ santī, arahattamapāpuṇiṃ.","thi-ap25:51.1":"“Yattha yattha nisinnāhaṃ, sadā jhānaparāyanā;","thi-ap25:51.3":"Jino tasmiṃ guṇe tuṭṭho, etadagge ṭhapesi maṃ.","thi-ap25:52.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavā.","thi-ap25:53.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","thi-ap25:54.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","thi-ap25:55.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ nandā bhikkhunī janapadakalyāṇī imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","thi-ap25:56.1":"Nandātheriyāpadānaṃ pañcamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
